<title>UK: UBS leads 100 mln mark Argentina FRB-linked bond.</title>
<headline>UBS leads 100 mln mark Argentina FRB-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Argentina FRB-linked bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPARCEM LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     11.90     MATURITY    08.APR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE  S-30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.375     REOFFER    99.50     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.125     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNDERLYING ARE ARGENTINA FRBS DUE MARCH 2005</p>
<p>	     EARLY REDEMPTION PROVISIONS</p>
<p>	     PRINICIPAL AMORTISATION BEGINS APRIL 1997 IN 17</p>
<p>		UNEQUAL SEMI-ANNUAL INSTALLMENTS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
